WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:08.310
2016 has already brought us lots of excellent
games to enjoy—so many that it's tough to

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.059
narrow down the absolute best of the bunch.

00:00:11.059 --> 00:00:14.490
Nevertheless, we've got something for every
kind of gamer when it comes to the best games

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.100
of the year...so far.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.330
Here's Looper's top seven video games for
the first half of 2016.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.410
Dark Souls III

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:26.980
Dark Souls III is all about dungeon crawling,
fighting difficult enemies, and dying...a

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:27.980
lot.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:31.570
When you think you've mastered your character,
all it takes is one botched dodge to totally

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:32.579
wreck you.

00:00:32.579 --> 00:00:37.910
The world of Dark Souls III is absolutely
gorgeous, with plenty of lore to discover—assuming

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:41.219
you don't throw your controller out the window
first.

00:00:41.219 --> 00:00:43.129
XCOM 2

00:00:43.129 --> 00:00:46.699
Finding out that humans lost the war against
the aliens who invaded during the first game

00:00:46.699 --> 00:00:48.230
is a bit of a bummer.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:52.059
But this turn-based tactics game is filled
with unpredictable missions that'll test your

00:00:52.059 --> 00:00:53.500
fortitude.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.160
Just don't get too attached to your squad—'cuz
they're probably gonna die.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:01.370
Sneaking onto the battlefield to fight ruthless
aliens is always a fun, nail-biting experience.

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:04.780
And if you're lucky, you might even survive.

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:05.830
The Witness

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:10.250
Nobody would've expected a 3D puzzler to do
so well in an era defined by Halo and Call

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.250
of Duty.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:15.830
But fans of the classic Myst games will enjoy
The Witness, which exercises your brain rather

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:17.370
than your reflexes.

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:21.940
Gamers explore an open-world island filled
with unconventional, thought-provoking puzzles.

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:24.850
The Witness puts you in a world that'll inspire
plenty of "eureka!"

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:25.850
moments.

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:29.890
And actually reaching its true ending puts
your wits and creativity to the test.

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:32.040
Fire Emblem Fates

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:36.460
Fire Emblem Fates: Birthright, Conquest, and
Revelation are all slightly different versions

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:40.560
of the same game, but they all offer some
of the best RPG experiences of the year so

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:41.560
far.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:44.900
The series' rock-paper-scissors approach to
combat is streamlined here enough to make

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:47.950
things captivating and engaging even for series
vets.

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:51.700
The plot between the three versions of the
game relies heavily on politics and scheming,

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:55.490
and depending which version of the game you
get, the story events and the unit classes

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:57.930
you'll have access to will be drastically
different.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.880
Play all of them.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:01.570
Hyper Light Drifter

00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:04.390
Hyper Light Drifter might be one of the best
games of the year.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:08.320
The vibrant colors make Hyper Light Drifter
stand out, while its controls and its combat

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:10.280
system are fantastic.

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:13.430
Exploring never gets boring or repetitive,
and as you play, you learn more about the

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:14.659
world and its dangers.

00:02:14.659 --> 00:02:18.319
Soon, you'll be completely sucked in and never
want to leave.

00:02:18.319 --> 00:02:20.780
Uncharted 4: A Thief's End

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.799
The fourth game in the Uncharted series is
already a modern classic.

00:02:24.799 --> 00:02:28.410
After enjoying monumental success with the
first three installments, developer Naughty

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:31.129
Dog rose to the the challenge and topped themselves.

00:02:31.129 --> 00:02:35.400
Uncharted 4 exceeded expectations, ending
the series on a high note.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.400
"Thanks."

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.599
"Aw, this is nuts!"

00:02:39.599 --> 00:02:43.950
With great storytelling and amazingly gorgeous
visuals and gameplay, Uncharted 4 is a must-buy

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.620
for all PS4-owners.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:47.620
Overwatch

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:51.540
What can we say about Blizzard's team-based
shooter Overwatch that hasn't been said a

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.799
thousand times already?

00:02:52.799 --> 00:02:55.959
That it managed to breathe new life into a
tired genre?

00:02:55.959 --> 00:02:58.319
That it's got something to offer every type
of player?

00:02:58.319 --> 00:03:03.180
That its cast of colorful characters, tight
controls, and fantastic visuals all contribute

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:06.250
to it being simply one of the most fun games
to come out this year?

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.930
Yeah—that about covers all of it.

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:08.930
Go get Overwatch.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.040
We'll be waiting for you.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.560
And thanks for watching!

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:14.220
Subscribe to our YouTube channel to watch
more videos like the one you just saw.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:17.040
And leave a comment to let us know which games
you think should have made the list...

